@startuml usecases_auth
!theme plain

title Módulo: Auth

package "Auth" {
  usecase "LoginWithEmailUseCase" as login
  usecase "LogoutUseCase" as logout
  usecase "RecoverPasswordUseCase" as recover
}

actor Usuário as user

user --> login
user --> logout
user --> recover

note right of login
  **Input:** email, password
  **Output:** UserCredential
  **Regras:**
  - Validar formato email
  - Verificar credenciais
  - Gerar token de sessão
end note

note right of logout
  **Input:** userId
  **Output:** void
  **Regras:**
  - Invalidar token
  - Limpar cache local
end note

note right of recover
  **Input:** email
  **Output:** void
  **Regras:**
  - Verificar se email existe
  - Enviar link de recuperação
end note

@enduml
